<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Manpower added to list.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Manpower added to list.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it added Manpower Inc to its &quot;fresh money buy list&quot; and its &quot;model portfolio.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Morgan said that by adding Manpower to the model portfolio, it cut the cash portion of the portfolio by one percent to six percent.  The rest of the portfolio remains in stocks.</p>
</text>
